<div class="manifesto-card">
    <p>Welcome to our Library Management System. Our platform is designed to make library management simple, fast, and organized.</>
    <p>It helps users manage books, members, and borrowing records efficiently through an easy-to-use interface. </p>
    <p>Our goal is to provide a reliable solution that saves time and makes accessing library resources more convenient for everyone.</p>
